3. Pickthall English translation (1930)
-----------------------------------------

Work:     Marmaduke Pickthall, The Meaning of the Glorious Koran (first published 1930; the translator died in 1936).
          Public domain.
Text via: the Project Gutenberg e-text #16955 (https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/16955), catalogued as "Public domain in the
          USA". Only the Pickthall column was used; the e-text's header and licence wording are not part of QURRA's data.
          The e-text was proofed by a volunteer from a file of unknown origin, so typographical errors are possible.
Kept as:  not redistributed raw (staging/ is outside git); SHA-256 3b96fa3ad318ab9d91db53b25100d5169fafe3a1ecb993e7c36ffff55bf9d8bc.
Used in:  data/translations/en-pickthall-1930.json (wrapped lines joined, text otherwise verbatim) and js/generated/translations.js.
          Eight ayahs (17:32-33, 39:45-46, 45:31-32, 56:25-26) are left without text because the e-text merges each pair
          under one verse number; see data/translations/en-pickthall-1930.alignment.json.


